<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 13,000 MT were down 84 percent from the prior week and 89 percent under the 4-week average.  Increases for Mexico (30,100 MT) and Japan (20,600 MT) were partly offset by decreases for Spain (38,100 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 170,500 MT were up one-third from the previous week and two-thirds from the 4-week average.  The primary destinations were Mexico (71,300 MT) and Spain (59,000 MT).</p>
</text>
